The final model run for 2026 that is used in the Assessment is called:
v23_3f_3s_2016_FINAL_2026_Model.RDS

As the assessment document was almost finished, it was discovered that the 
survey age data for 2024 was triplicated. The model was rerun with the corrected
data and results were very similar to the final assessment model. These results are
saved as:
v23_3f_3s_2016_fixed_FINAL.RDS